<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-C FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-C FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.88 vs   0.63</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.34 vs   1.12</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.04 vs   1.20</p>
<p> Sales		   25.37 vs  20.67</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.44 vs   1.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.65 vs   2.19</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.34 vs   2.33</p>
<p> Sales		   48.62 vs  40.02</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Cieszyn</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
